window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-4bba8fa30e54df2a"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"game-development\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">游戏开发</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。将 <code>.md</code> 附加到页面 URL 后，可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>更快地制作游戏循环、界面和玩法原型。</p> <p>Codex 与图像生成结合使用，在制作浏览器游戏及其他类型的游戏时尤其有用。以下用例可帮助你把想法变成可运行的游戏。</p> <p><a id=\"build-the-first-playable-loop\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">做出第一个可玩的版本</h2> <p>让 Codex 根据游戏简介生成一个可在浏览器中运行的版本，其中包括素材、操作方式和可供你测试的游戏循环。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/browser-games\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">创建浏览器游戏（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 先把游戏简介整理成明确的计划，再制作真正的浏览器游戏……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"tackle-hard-game-logic\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">解决复杂的游戏逻辑</h2> <p>通过运行自我评估循环，让 Codex 反复改进复杂的游戏算法。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/iterate-on-difficult-problems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">迭代解决难题（本地尚未收录）</a>：为 Codex 提供一套评估系统，例如脚本和可审阅的产物，让它能够持续……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"triage-bugs-from-real-signals\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">根据真实反馈排查缺陷</h2> <p>在修改游戏之前，让 Codex 汇总缺陷报告、失败检查、日志和复现说明，并按优先级整理。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/automation-bug-triage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">自动整理缺陷分诊（本地尚未收录）</a>：让 Codex 检查近期告警、问题、失败检查、日志和聊天报告，并调整……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"review-before-merge\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">合并前进行审查</h2> <p>让 Codex 在 GitHub 中自动审查拉取请求，发现回归问题和缺失的测试，帮助你更快部署。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/github-code-reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">审查 GitHub 拉取请求（本地尚未收录）</a>：在 GitHub 中使用 Codex 代码审查，自动找出回归问题、缺失的测试以及……</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"game-development\">Game development</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Prototype loops, UI, and gameplay faster.</p> <p>Codex, combined with image generation, is particularly powerful to create browser-based and other types of games. These use cases will help you turn ideas into live games.</p> <h2 id=\"build-the-first-playable-loop\">Build the first playable loop</h2> <p>Ask Codex to turn a game brief into a browser build with assets, controls, and a loop you can test.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/browser-games\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Create browser-based games (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex to turn a game brief into first a well-defined plan, and then a real browser-based...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"tackle-hard-game-logic\">Tackle hard game logic</h2> <p>Leverage Codex to iterate on complex game algorithms by running a self-evaluation loop.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/iterate-on-difficult-problems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Iterate on difficult problems (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give Codex an evaluation system, such as scripts and reviewable artifacts, so it can keep...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"triage-bugs-from-real-signals\">Triage bugs from real signals</h2> <p>Use Codex to gather bug reports, failing checks, logs, and repro notes into a prioritized list before it patches the game.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/automation-bug-triage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Automate bug triage (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Ask Codex to check recent alerts, issues, failed checks, logs, and chat reports, tune the...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"review-before-merge\">Review before merge</h2> <p>Have Codex in GitHub automatically review PRs and catch regressions and missing tests for faster deployment.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/github-code-reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Review GitHub pull requests (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex code review in GitHub to automatically surface regressions, missing tests, and...</li> </ul>"};
